        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c6d5eb2f-3c57-46e1-b836-e889c4ea43e4).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. A client at GAMA requires a very specific house call to deal with five individuals who have thoroughly ruined the facility&apos;s pristine vibe.   Your targets: an overworked surgeon, a confused maintenance worker, a loud VIP Texan who lost his pants, a guy just trying to relax in the spa, and a worker hiding out watching his buddy game.   The client wants this unprofessional circus permanently dismissed before hospital management notices. Time to scrub in.",
